===Etymology===
From {{AGr.}} {{term|διαλεκτική|tr=dialektike||the art of argument through interactive questioning and answering}}, from {{term|διαλεκτικός|tr=dialektikos||competent debater}}, from {{term|διαλέγομαι|tr=dialegomai||to participate in a [[dialogue]]}}, from {{term|διά|tr=dia||inter, through}} + {{term|λέγειν|tr=legein||to speak}}.

